WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Jamie’s standing medium trades with Ken’s wake-up attack.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.650
Crouching heavy punch links after the trade.

3
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.400
OD Swagger Step launches Ken.

4
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.900
The sweep target’s kick follow-up continues the juggle.

5
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.100
Jamie drinks again while Ken remains knocked down.
